              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "little_veggie-monster"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really good smoothie! I recently went vegetarian, and have been trying out a lot of smoothies to add protein powder and wheat germ to. This is defintely high on the list so far. I did change it a little, using fresh strawberries, 6 ice cubes, and a little protein-supplement powder. Defintely a keeper!",
